# hachimaki-dev — Cursor Rules

## Project
Personal website: React 18 + Vite + CSS native + Supabase. Single admin. GitHub Pages deploy.

## Critical Rules
- JavaScript ONLY — no TypeScript (.ts/.tsx)
- CSS variables ONLY from `src/styles/tokens.css` — never hardcode colors/sizes/fonts
- NO CSS frameworks (Tailwind, Bootstrap, etc.)
- Import Supabase client from `src/lib/supabase.js` ONLY — never create new instances
- NO localStorage for business data — only Supabase
- Handle loading + error + empty states in every async component
- Use `useToast()` for user feedback
- Migrations go in `migrations/NNN_desc.sql` (local, gitignored)
- kebab-case CSS classes, PascalCase components, camelCase hooks/utils

## Structure
- `src/components/ui/` → Button, Input, Card, Modal, Toast, PageLoader, EmptyState, Badge, Countdown
- `src/components/layout/` → Header, Footer, PageWrapper, AdminLayout
- `src/pages/public/` → Home, Blog, BlogPost, Portfolio, ProjectDetail, PhotosPage, VisitantesPage
- `src/pages/public/Stream/` → StreamRoomPage, CasterPage, ViewerPage, StreamChat
- `src/pages/admin/` → Dashboard, AdminBlog, BlogEditor, AdminPortfolio, ProjectEditor, Settings
- `src/pages/admin/Streams/` → AdminStreamsPage
- `src/features/` → auth, blog, portfolio, streaming, visitor
- `src/features/streaming/lib/` → signalingChannel, peerManager, viewerPeer, signalingCleanup, streamLogger
- `src/features/streaming/hooks/` → useMediaDevices, useMediaRecorder, useRooms, usePresence, usePublicLiveStreams, useRecordingUpload, useChat
- `src/styles/tokens.css` → ALL design tokens

## DB Tables
- `profiles` — admin profile (1 row)
- `blog_posts` — slug, title, content, published, published_at
- `projects` — slug, title, tags[], featured, published, sort_order
- `rooms` — streaming rooms: slug, caster_id, status
- `room_members` — presence per room
- `stream_state` — is_live, viewer_count
- `signaling_messages` — WebRTC SDP/ICE
- `recordings` — stream recordings in Storage
- `chat_messages` — live chat per room
- `photos` — custom photo gallery
- `visitor_logs` — visitor tracking logs

## Accent Color: #c8f000 | Font: Space Grotesk | Dark theme bg: #0d0d0d

## 🔄 Auto-Maintenance (MANDATORY)
After every architectural change (new/removed components, pages, hooks, routes, tables, tokens, deps), update ALL agent config files: `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.cursorrules`, `.windsurfrules`, `.clinerules`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`. Do it automatically, no permission needed.
- `photos` — custom photo gallery
